														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2435504">
									

<p>I think they are saying that if an infinite number of possible universes exist, this includes all imaginary universes, including imaginary universes that are in contact with all other universes including ours. Since this isn't observed, they are postulating that there is some force that makes it impossible for those universes to communicate.</p>
<p>However this is flawed, because an infinite number of universes does not actually mean that all imaginary universes exist, rather that an infinite number of universes with normal distribution of probabilities across only possible events exists.</p>

							</div>

								
